WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:07.067
In the number 364, what is the value of the digit in the hundreds place? Let us think

00:00:07.067 --> 00:00:13.171
carefully. 364 has 3 hundreds, 6 tens and 4 ones. The answer is 300. Great work!

00:00:14.033 --> 00:00:20.765
In the number 478, what is the value of the digit in the tens place? Let us think

00:00:20.765 --> 00:00:26.748
carefully. 478 has 4 hundreds, 7 tens and 8 ones. The answer is 70. Great work!

00:00:27.617 --> 00:00:33.761
In the number 205, what is the value of the digit in the ones place? Let us think

00:00:33.761 --> 00:00:39.222
carefully. 205 has 2 hundreds, 0 tens and 5 ones. The answer is 5. Great work!

00:00:40.033 --> 00:00:46.821
In the number 629, what is the value of the digit in the hundreds place? Let us think

00:00:46.821 --> 00:00:52.855
carefully. 629 has 6 hundreds, 2 tens and 9 ones. The answer is 600. Great work!
